{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25859","headline":"入扬州郭 · 李绅","name":"入扬州郭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菊芳沙渚残花少，柳过秋风坠叶疎。\n堤绕门津喧井市，路交村陌混樵渔。\n畏冲生客呼童仆，欲指潮痕问里闾。\n非爲掩身羞白发，自缘多病喜肩舆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}